{"id":"972d65715d317b31","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/725_ALCF.md","title":"725 ALCF","display":"725_ALCF","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"725-ALCF\">725 ALCF</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是概念名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是角色名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_F\\subseteq N_R\">\\(N_F\\subseteq N_R\\)</span> 是功能角色名集合。</p>\n<p>ALCF 的概念构造子为下列本地构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}:N_F\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}:N_F\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in N_F\">\\(F\\in N_F\\)</span>，显示</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leq 1F=\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leq 1F=\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-概念表达式\">2. 概念表达式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span> 为满足下列条款的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\operatorname{name}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\neg C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(C\\sqcap D,C\\sqcup D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\forall R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\exists R.C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in N_F\">\\(F\\in N_F\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}(F)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}(F)\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-包含式、TBox-与功能角色声明\">3. 包含式、TBox 与功能角色声明</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n\\{(C,D):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>功能角色声明集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Func}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}=N_F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Func}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}=N_F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TBox 载体为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TBox}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-自由名字与替换\">4. 自由名字与替换</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\">\\(\\operatorname{FN}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathcal P(N_C\\cup N_R)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\top)=\\operatorname{FN}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(A)=\\{A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\neg C)=\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{FN}(C)\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\forall R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FN}(\\exists R.C)=\\{R\\}\\cup\\operatorname{FN}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq 1F)=\\{F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FN}(\\leq 1F)=\\{F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义无绑定名字函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}(C)=\\varnothing\n\\quad(C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个名字排序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{N_C,N_R\\}\\)</span> 固定无重复枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\">\\(e^S_0,e^S_1,\\ldots\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq S\">\\(X\\subseteq S\\)</span> 有限，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(S,X)=e^S_m,\n\\quad\nm=\\min\\{k:e^S_k\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\qquad\n\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_C:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\qquad\n\\theta_R:N_R\\to N_R\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_R[N_F]\\subseteq N_F\">\\(\\theta_R[N_F]\\subseteq N_F\\)</span>，定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其构造子条款为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\top)=\\top,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(A)=\\theta_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\neg C)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcap D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcap\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(C\\sqcup D)=\\operatorname{Sub}(C)\\sqcup\\operatorname{Sub}(D),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\forall R.C)=\\forall\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}(\\exists R.C)=\\exists\\theta_R(R).\\operatorname{Sub}(C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\leq 1F)=\\leq 1\\theta_R(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}(\\leq 1F)=\\leq 1\\theta_R(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n\\{(C,C):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall R.C\">\\(\\forall R.C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R.C\">\\(\\exists R.C\\)</span> 与功能角色上界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq 1F\">\\(\\leq 1F\\)</span> 都不是变量绑定构造子；捕获避免重命名就是保持排序的有限支撑替换，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span> 只用于选择未出现在有限名字集中的新名字。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T)\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf T}(\\mathcal T)=\\mathcal T\\)</span>。基础布尔包含公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCbase}}\n=\n\\{C\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqsubseteq\\top,\\ \\bot\\sqsubseteq C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq C,\\ C\\sqcap D\\sqsubseteq D,\\ C\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D,\\ D\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup D:C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{C\\sqcap\\neg C\\sqsubseteq\\bot,\\ \\top\\sqsubseteq C\\sqcup\\neg C:C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>功能角色公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}\n=\n\\{\\top\\sqsubseteq\\leq 1F:F\\in N_F\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\leq 1F\\sqsubseteq\\leq 1F:F\\in N_F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}\n=\n\\{\\top\\sqsubseteq\\leq 1F:F\\in N_F\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\leq 1F\\sqsubseteq\\leq 1F:F\\in N_F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}=\\{(((C,D),(D,E)),(C,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}=\\{(((C,D),(C,E)),(C,D\\sqcap E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}=\\{(((C,E),(D,E)),(C\\sqcup D,E)):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\forall R.C,\\forall R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}=\\{(((C,D)),(\\exists R.C,\\exists R.D)):R\\in N_R,\\ C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{(((C,\\bot)),(C,D)):C,D\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>功能上界保持规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}\n=\n\\{(((C,\\leq 1F)),(C,\\leq 1F)):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\ F\\in N_F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}\n=\n\\{(((C,\\leq 1F)),(C,\\leq 1F)):C\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\ F\\in N_F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 出发的 ALCF 证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(I_0,\\ldots,I_{m-1})\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span>，且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T)\">\\(I_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{tr}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcap I}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\">\\(((I_j,I_k),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\sqcup E}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\exists}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}\">\\(((I_j),I_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T,N_F,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T,N_F,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 是满足上述八类行条件且末项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(C,D)\">\\((C,D)\\)</span> 的非空有限序列。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可导出关系\">8. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,N_F\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}C\\sqsubseteq D\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T,N_F\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}C\\sqsubseteq D\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T,N_F,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}(\\mathcal T,N_F,\\pi,C\\sqsubseteq D)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与解释\">9. 语义结构与解释</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}=\n\\{\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}:\\mathcal T\\text{ 有限}\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}\\times\\{\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\)</span> 是所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\">\\(\\mathcal I=(\\Delta,\\iota_C,\\iota_R)\\)</span> 的集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta\\ne\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\iota_C:N_C\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta),\\quad\n\\iota_R:N_R\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta\\times\\Delta),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且每个功能角色解释为偏函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in N_F\\ \\forall x,y,z\\in\\Delta\\,\n(((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(F)\\land(x,z)\\in\\iota_R(F))\\Rightarrow y=z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in N_F\\ \\forall x,y,z\\in\\Delta\\,\n(((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(F)\\land(x,z)\\in\\iota_R(F))\\Rightarrow y=z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\">\\(\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\Delta)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\top\\rrbracket=\\Delta,\\quad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\llbracket A\\rrbracket=\\iota_C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg C\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\llbracket C\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg C\\rrbracket=\\Delta\\setminus\\llbracket C\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcap D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cap\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\quad\n\\llbracket C\\sqcup D\\rrbracket=\\llbracket C\\rrbracket\\cup\\llbracket D\\rrbracket,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\forall R.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\forall y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\Rightarrow y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\exists R.C\\rrbracket=\\{x:\\exists y((x,y)\\in\\iota_R(R)\\land y\\in\\llbracket C\\rrbracket)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\leq 1F\\rrbracket=\\{x:|\\{y:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(F)\\}|\\leq 1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\leq 1F\\rrbracket=\\{x:|\\{y:(x,y)\\in\\iota_R(F)\\}|\\leq 1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-满足关系与语义后承\">10. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}C\\sqsubseteq D\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\llbracket C\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\subseteq\n\\llbracket D\\rrbracket_{\\mathcal I}^{\\mathsf{ALCF}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal K\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}I\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=(\\mathcal T,\\varnothing,\\varnothing)\\land I\\in\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal I\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n((\\forall J\\in\\mathcal T\\ \\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}J)\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal I\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-特征差异\">11. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>ALCF 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{funcRole},\\operatorname{atMostOneFunc}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastRole},\\operatorname{atMostRole},\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{nom}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{funcRole},\\operatorname{atMostOneFunc}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{atLeastRole},\\operatorname{atMostRole},\\operatorname{roleIncl},\\operatorname{inv},\\operatorname{nom}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求功能角色集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_F\">\\(N_F\\)</span> 与公理族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\sqsubseteq\\leq 1F\">\\(\\top\\sqsubseteq\\leq 1F\\)</span> 同时出现；它只允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in N_F\">\\(F\\in N_F\\)</span> 形成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq 1F\">\\(\\leq 1F\\)</span>，不同于 ALCN 的任意角色任意上界。</p>\n<h1 id=\"12.-整个形式系统\">12. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,N_F,\\mathsf{Func}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n=\n(N_C,N_R,N_F,\\mathsf{Func}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\mathsf{Inc}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\operatorname{FN},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{fresh}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\theta_C,\\theta_R},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket^{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统不含一般数目限制、限定数目限制、角色层级、逆角色或名词；语义只解释功能角色上界和 ALC 概念构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"725-ALCF","text":"725 ALCF","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-概念表达式","text":"2. 概念表达式","level":1},{"id":"3.-包含式、TBox-与功能角色声明","text":"3. 包含式、TBox 与功能角色声明","level":1},{"id":"4.-自由名字与替换","text":"4. 自由名字与替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则","text":"6. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可导出关系","text":"8. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与解释","text":"9. 语义结构与解释","level":1},{"id":"10.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"10. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-特征差异","text":"11. 特征差异","level":1},{"id":"12.-整个形式系统","text":"12. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_F)","display":true},{"tex":"N_C","display":false},{"tex":"N_R","display":false},{"tex":"N_F\\subseteq N_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name},\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom},\n\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj},\n\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists},\n\\operatorname{atmostOneFeature}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{name}:N_C\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{top},\\operatorname{bottom}\\in\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{conj},\\operatorname{disj}:\n\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{forall},\\operatorname{exists}:\nN_R\\times\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Con}_{\\mathsf{ALCF}},"